@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### Create a tutor (expect 201)
POST {{base}}/tutors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Rivera", "email": "Ana@Example.com", "subjects": ["Math", "SAT"] }

### List tutors (expect 200, paginated)
GET {{base}}/tutors?page=0&size=10

### Validation error (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/tutors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "email": "not-an-email" }

### Duplicate email (expect 409)
POST {{base}}/tutors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Someone Else", "email": "ana@example.com", "subjects": [] }

### Get one — paste a real id from the create response
GET {{base}}/tutors/PASTE-ID-HERE

### Archive (expect 204)
DELETE {{base}}/tutors/PASTE-ID-HERE